notes.content:
Hey everyone! 

I am really happy to see that so many of you have been enjoying the game. Thank you so much for giving it a chance and also for your feedback and reviews! It's been wonderful so far!


You can join the official Dungeons Discord server here: https://discord.gg/Uh9gSj3Gvq


Here is a little roadmap for the Early Access period. It is in no particular order at the moment, and might get tweaked or get more specific as we progress. The text version is below the image. 


[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44330273/3180779ba604f40c19d08aea6fa9e2b66481869c.png[/img]

[list]
[*] Steam achievements and cloud saves;
[*] More enemies and bosses;
[*] More levels and secrets;
[*] More rings, weapons, eyeballs, effects and synergies;
[*] More spells and making spell system more usable early game;
[*] The bracelet system (it is partially implemented but not present enough in game!);
[*] More ways to upgrade your starting weapon and spend dream spheres;
[*] More dialogue and unlocks through it;
[*] Key guessing system that's not entirely based on colour;
[*] Balancing, bug fixes, performance improvements, etc.
[/list]
